{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles. Overcome challenges. Explore a world full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Eternal Decay Souls, you embark on a journey through ancient ruins, forgotten temples and exotic landscapes, solving intriguing puzzles and overcoming platforming challenges to restore balance to a world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc The Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ancient Crystal of Harmony has been shattered, spreading its energy across different regions and leaving the world in chaos. Now, adventurers can activate mystical portals and prevent darkness from consuming everything. But the journey will not be easy\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and challenges. Solve puzzles, discover hidden patterns and manipulate mechanisms, search and activate platforms to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect different Relics to evolve \u2013 Coins, gems and relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the last portal, a Dark Guardian protects the key to restoring balance\u2026 but the end of the journey may be just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a journey! Do you have what it takes to unlock the secrets of Eternal Decay Souls?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583680?t=1743026649","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583680?t=1743026649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583680/3ce9eeccd2b356ca510e8e5302fee16c002e1024/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743026649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583680/3ce9eeccd2b356ca510e8e5302fee16c002e1024/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743026649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles. Overcome challenges. Explore a world full of mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Eternal Decay Souls, you embark on a journey through ancient ruins, forgotten temples and exotic landscapes, solving intriguing puzzles and overcoming platforming challenges to restore balance to a world on the brink of collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcdc The Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The ancient Crystal of Harmony has been shattered, spreading its energy across different regions and leaving the world in chaos. Now, adventurers can activate mystical portals and prevent darkness from consuming everything. But the journey will not be easy\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and challenges. Solve puzzles, discover hidden patterns and manipulate mechanisms, search and activate platforms to advance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect different Relics to evolve \u2013 Coins, gems and relics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the last portal, a Dark Guardian protects the key to restoring balance\u2026 but the end of the journey may be just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a journey! Do you have what it takes to unlock the secrets of Eternal Decay Souls?</p>","developers":["Clovek Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583680/b857e968a313a414180e778f4e4fd056e733b85c/header.jpg?t=1743026649","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><u